# STRSST on the primary (V7R1M0) as QSECOFR: the service tools sign-on
# only. No service tools user ID or password is typed (none is in the
# oracle's .env): the display is captured and left with F3 at once.
wait "Sign On"
signon
settle 3000
timeout 30000
key enter
settle 2000
type call qcmd
key enter
wait "Command Entry"
type STRSST
key enter
settle 3000
snap sst-signon
show
key f3
settle 2000
show
